Hello Lojban community!

I have more or less recently started to learn Lojban and promptly
decided to pass the knowledge so gained on at the 22nd. Chaos
Communication Congress (see http://www.ccc.de/congress/2005/).

So, I'm going to hold a short talk introducing Lojban. It is titled
"Lojban - A Hackers' spoken Language" and tries to motivate the
hacker/geek/whatever crowd to have a look at Lojban.

In addition to the talk I have prepared a short paper (8 pages) which
will go into the conference proceedings. Maybe you would like to put it
or a link to it on the website? Here it is:

http://www.scannedinavian.org/~pesco/distfiles/sm-2005-lojban.pdf

Please send me any comments/corrections/... you might have! I've most
probably made some mistakes, albeit hopefully none too serious... ;)


Regards,
Sven Moritz
           
